#: ../../source/index.rst:5 dc2c552259cb4f43827eca4401ca6b69
msgid "_`Introduction`"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/index.rst:7 eebecf030aa44a9a89dea202aeb18d92
msgid ""
":code:`foc` is a field-oriented-control library for three-phase PMSM "
"drives. One engineering constraint drives every design choice: **the "
"control loop must be predictable** — no heap, no exceptions, no virtual "
"calls, no hidden allocation in the code path that runs every PWM period."
msgstr ""
":code:`foc` 是面向三相 PMSM 的磁场定向控制（FOC）库。所有设计取舍都服务于同一条工程约束：**控制环必须可预测**——跑在每个"
" PWM 周期的代码路径里没有堆、没有异常、没有虚函数调用、没有隐式内存分配。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:11 036b86b5c3a74a1ca05e9c12d8ee79b2
