#: ../../source/index.rst:61 441b17f1ed0b47a0aaf32fa306d870cf
msgid ""
"One rule to remember: link the aggregate target :code:`foc::foc`. It "
"carries both :code:`foc::foc_c` and :code:`foc::foc_cpp`, and the package"
" metadata guarantees the order."
msgstr ""
"只需记一条规则：链接聚合目标 :code:`foc::foc`。它同时带 :code:`foc::foc_c` 与 "
":code:`foc::foc_cpp`，顺序由包元数据保证。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:66 723a2bbf3a26442fa69ef05405788695
msgid ""
"C consumers still link the C++ runtime. The C ABI is stable, the "
"implementation is C++: set :code:`LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX` (or add one empty "
":code:`.cpp`), otherwise you will see :code:`undefined reference to "
"__cxa_*`. This boundary is documented, not papered over."
msgstr ""
"C 使用者仍要链接 C++ 运行时。C ABI 是稳定的，但实现是 C++：把 :code:`LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX` "
"设上（或加一个空 :code:`.cpp`），否则会看到 :code:`undefined reference to "
"__cxa_*`。这条边界写在文档里，不粉饰。"

